This product is a modified version of "shunt" from spotify/portal-ai-plugins
(https://github.com/spotify/portal-ai-plugins, commit 3c24ca3), licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Changes from upstream:
- scripts/lib/aika.sh (Portal CLI / AiKA transport) replaced by
  scripts/lib/muse.sh, which runs one headless `muse exec` turn.
- The bulk-reader and code-writer mode instructions now travel in the prompt.
- Hooks block by exiting 2 with the reason on stderr, and allow silently, so
  the same scripts work as Claude Code and Codex PreToolUse hooks.
- check-bash-read accepts a shell command given as an argv array.
- Skill and hook text now points at Muse instead of AiKA.
